sound TZB.aac
text @[Misae]
text Sorry...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I then realize.
text Misae-san just rejected me.
text All I could do... was withdraw from the room in silence.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I stand up without saying a word, and reach out for the doorknob.
text Something's swirling about around my feet.
text It's the cat.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Are you coming with me?)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Well, I suppose not...)
