text I open the door and start moving out into the hallway.
text The cat continues looking up at me from inside the room.
text It seems he only came to see me off.
text @[Tomoya]
text Bye, then.
text I bid the cat my farewell and leave that place behind.
text When I finally turn around from her room, I realize how comical it was that I'd been working so desperately to win her.
text I was actually making a real effort.
text In my eyes, this was quite an amazing thing.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Although I'm a bit tired now...)
text Now, then, I guess I'll go back to my normal lifestyle.
text ...Together with that idiot.
