fi
text @[Tomoya]
text The woman I met here in this room, spent time with, and finally ended up falling in love with.
text @[Tomoya]
text It doesn't matter whether you're doing nothing but growing old, or that you're not shining anymore the way you used to...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...That's just the kind of person I ended up falling in love with.
text @[Tomoya]
text I like you as you are right now, Misae-san.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGMS16EH"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
